    {
      "id": 990000000210, "plugin": "Cardinal", "model": "TextEditor", "pos": [179, 0],
      "params": [],
      "data": {
        "filepath": "", "lang": "None", "width": 33,
        "etext": "MODULAR-SYNTH / NIGHT LANTERNS\n\nOriginal dual-timbre, eight-voice MIDI patch.\nMorphVCO (one octave down) -> FoldDrive ->\nStateFilter LP -> DualVCA A -> Echo LEFT.\nFMVoice (near 2:1 ratio) -> DualVCA B ->\nEcho RIGHT. ADSR gates both VCA channels.\n\nHostTime BEAT drives ClockedLFO; RESET aligns\nphase. Its 1/4-beat-cycle ratio moves pulse\nwidth and FoldDrive bias in a four-beat arc.\nWhen transport stops, LFO free-runs at 0.25 Hz.\nMacro8 output controls all eight named targets.\nRecall A Ember, B Lantern, C Flare, D Dusk.\nThe two layers crossfeed through StereoEcho.\n\nKeep speaker volume low: eight-voice headroom\nand live audio/DAW output are not verified.\nSaved graph validated against source only.\n"
      }
    }
  ],
